                                "sense_id": "2112f811-5a4f-3d6d-a6c8-c1f4f66d29d1",
                                "text": "Tijdens de zomervakantie plannen we een bootreis over de rivier.",
                                "translation": "During the summer vacation, we are planning a boat trip on the river.",
                                "english": "During the summer vacation, we are planning a boat trip on the river."
